TITLE Albite kinetic dissolution with H2S gas at 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    Fe(+3) 4e-3
    Fe(+2) 4e-3
    units mol/kgw
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -time true
    -totals Si
END
